PREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>

### Class

<https://dev.fiafcore.org/Format> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Format"@en ;
    dc:description "The physical medium, file container, encoding, or deliverable package in which a moving image Manifestation or Item is fixed."@en ;
    dc:source <> ;
.

### Subclasses

